# #5837, the claimless advance: the split transfer and the receiver's close heads.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestTransferNotInForeignHigh
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: T3: a transfer record is applied by its appending activation but not counted in its token's foreignHigh, so a twin passes it
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithSplitBirth = TRUE, WithKeyMove = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1, WithMixedVersion = FALSE

--- FIND
    Max({startHead - 1, evFloor} \cup {o \in Offs : o >= TrackStart /\ author[o] \in Acts \ {a}})
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: transfer records are not tracked by token.
    Max({startHead - 1, evFloor} \cup {o \in Offs : o >= TrackStart /\ author[o] \in Acts \ {a} /\ o \notin tRecs})
--- END
